Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Flask-Login like user session management for FastAPI
 FastAPI-Login manages the user session of a FastAPI application. It reads a
 JSON Web Token from a cookie or a header, loads the user it belongs to
 through a function the application provides, and redirects or rejects the
 requests of users who are not logged in.
 .
 Packaged in the UniTotem repository because Debian does not ship it.
